  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>) (1).<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, phương trình (1) muốn có nghiệm thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có các nghiệm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy tổng bình phương các nghiệm phương trình đã cho bằng\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
